@startuml class-v1
title Class – Bảng thanh toán – v1
' Phiên bản: v1 | Đầu vào: sys-us-01..05-v1.md, seq-us-01..05-v1.puml, 03-detailed-design-v1.md | Prompt: P-21
' Mục đích: lớp miền, service, interface và quan hệ của module Bảng thanh toán
' Phạm vi: US-PAY-01..05; PAY-01..08; NFR-PAY-01
' Nguồn: TA-SPEC §1-6; TA-PDF tr.1-3
' Trạng thái: Bản lần chạy đầu – Design Pending Approval
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 25
skinparam ranksep 60
set separator none
hide empty members
left to right direction

package "PaymentManagement.Domain" {
  enum PaymentSheetStatus {
    Draft
    PendingApproval
    Approved
    Rejected
    Cancelled
  }

  enum UserRole {
    NVKD
    KTT
    GDKD
  }

  class BillingPeriod <<value object>> {
    + Start : DateOnly
    + End : DateOnly
    + Kind : string
  }
  note bottom of BillingPeriod
    Tháng hay quý, khóa duy nhất:
    Blocked by OQ-01
  end note

  class CurrentUser <<value object>> {
    + UserId : string
    + Role : UserRole
  }

  class PaymentSheet {
    - Id : Guid
    - ContractId : int
    - Period : BillingPeriod
    - PriceListId : string
    - Status : PaymentSheetStatus
    - TotalAmount : decimal
    - CalculatedAt : DateTimeOffset
    - CreatedBy : string
    - CreatedAt : DateTimeOffset
    - SubmittedBy : string?
    - SubmittedAt : DateTimeOffset?
    - DecidedBy : string?
    - DecidedAt : DateTimeOffset?
    - RejectionReason : string?
    - CancelReason : string?
    - Version : int
    + Lines : IReadOnlyList<PaymentLine>
    + RecalculateTotal() : decimal
    + RequiredApproverRole() : UserRole
  }
  note right of PaymentSheet
    CreatedBy dùng cho PAY-07 – "người lập": OQ-US03-01.
    TotalAmount: thời điểm, VAT, làm tròn – OQ-US03-03.
    CancelReason bắt buộc hay không – OQ-US05-03.
    RejectionReason giới hạn độ dài – OQ-US03-04.
    RequiredApproverRole(): PAY-06, dùng chung cho submit và approve/reject.
  end note

  class PaymentLine {
    - Id : Guid
    - ServiceCode : string
    - Quantity : decimal
    - UnitPrice : decimal
    - LineAmount : decimal
    - QuantitySourceRef : string
    - PriceSourceRef : string
    - CalculatedAt : DateTimeOffset
  }
  note bottom of PaymentLine
    LineAmount = Quantity x UnitPrice tại thời điểm tính (PAY-03).
    Snapshot nguồn: DD-04. Gộp/tách dòng, dữ liệu rỗng: OQ-US01-04.
  end note

  class AuditEntry {
    - Id : Guid
    - PaymentSheetId : Guid
    - Action : string
    - ActorId : string
    - ActorRole : UserRole
    - OccurredAt : DateTimeOffset
    - FromStatus : PaymentSheetStatus?
    - ToStatus : PaymentSheetStatus?
    - Before : string
    - After : string
    - Reason : string?
    - AttachmentRef : string?
  }
  note bottom of AuditEntry
    Action ∈ create, update, submit, approve, reject, adjust, cancel.
    Append-only, ghi cùng giao dịch (NFR-PAY-01, DD-03).
  end note

  class PaymentAdjustment <<Blocked by OQ-03>> {
    - Id : Guid
    - PaymentSheetId : Guid
    - Content : string
    - MinutesRef : string
    - CreatedBy : string
    - CreatedAt : DateTimeOffset
  }
  note bottom of PaymentAdjustment
    [GIẢ ĐỊNH – Cần xác nhận] chỉ có nếu chọn phương án A
    (hồ sơ điều chỉnh riêng). Tiêu chí biên bản: OQ-US04-01.
  end note
}

package "PaymentManagement.Application" {
  class PaymentController {
    + OpenCreateForm() : IResult
    + SelectContract(contractId : int) : IResult
    + SelectPeriod(contractId : int, period : BillingPeriod) : IResult
    + Preview(request : PreviewRequest) : IResult
    + Create(request : CreateRequest) : IResult
    + OpenDraft(id : Guid) : IResult
    + Update(id : Guid, request : UpdateRequest) : IResult
    + GetById(id : Guid) : IResult
    + FindByContractPeriod(contractId : int, period : BillingPeriod) : IResult
    + Submit(id : Guid, expectedVersion : int) : IResult
    + Approve(id : Guid, expectedVersion : int) : IResult
    + Reject(id : Guid, reason : string, expectedVersion : int) : IResult
    + Adjust(id : Guid, request : AdjustRequest) : IResult
    + Cancel(id : Guid, reason : string?, expectedVersion : int) : IResult
  }

  class PaymentService {
    + OpenCreateForm(user : CurrentUser) : FormData
    + SelectContract(contractId : int, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    + SelectPeriod(contractId : int, period : BillingPeriod, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    + Preview(selection : Selection, user : CurrentUser) : PreviewResult
    + Create(selection : Selection, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    + OpenDraft(id : Guid, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    + Update(id : Guid, changes : DraftChanges, expectedVersion : int, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    + Submit(id : Guid, expectedVersion : int, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    + Cancel(id : Guid, reason : string?, expectedVersion : int, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    - ValidateSubmission(sheet : PaymentSheet) : Result
  }
  note right of PaymentService
    Submit: tổng < 0 bị chặn; tổng = 0 không bị chặn (PAY-04).
    Dòng bắt buộc: OQ-05. Quyền trình: OQ-US02-01.
    Quyền hủy: OQ-US05-01. Trường sửa Draft: OQ-US01-02.
  end note

  class PaymentApprovalService {
    + Approve(id : Guid, expectedVersion : int, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    + Reject(id : Guid, reason : string, expectedVersion : int, user : CurrentUser) : Result
    - IsCreator(userId : string, sheet : PaymentSheet) : bool
  }
  note right of PaymentApprovalService
    Dùng PaymentSheet.RequiredApproverRole(): đúng 500.000.000 đ – Blocked by OQ-02.
    Reject → Rejected hay Draft – Blocked by OQ-04.
  end note

  class PaymentAdjustmentService <<Blocked by OQ-03>> {
    + Adjust(id : Guid, content : string, minutesRef : string, expectedVersion : int, user : CurrentUser) : Result
  }

  interface IPaymentRepository {
    + GetById(id : Guid) : PaymentSheet?
    + FindByContractPeriod(contractId : int, period : BillingPeriod) : IReadOnlyList<PaymentSheet>
    + FindConflict(contractId : int, period : BillingPeriod, policy : UniquenessPolicy) : bool
    + Create(sheet : PaymentSheet) : WriteResult
    + Update(sheet : PaymentSheet, expectedStatus : PaymentSheetStatus, expectedVersion : int) : WriteResult
    + Transition(id : Guid, from : PaymentSheetStatus, to : PaymentSheetStatus, expectedVersion : int, reason : string?) : WriteResult
    + UpdateApproved(sheet : PaymentSheet, minutesRef : string, expectedVersion : int) : WriteResult
  }
  note bottom of IPaymentRepository
    WriteResult: OK / Conflict / Error (DD-02).
    UpdateApproved chỉ có nếu chọn phương án B của OQ-03.
    UniquenessPolicy: OQ-01, OQ-US05-02, OQ-D-01.
  end note

  interface IAdjustmentRepository <<Blocked by OQ-03>> {
    + Create(adjustment : PaymentAdjustment) : WriteResult
  }

  interface IAuditLog {
    + Append(entry : AuditEntry) : WriteResult
  }

  interface IUnitOfWork {
    + Begin() : void
    + Commit() : CommitOutcome
    + Rollback() : void
  }

  interface INotifier {
    + NotifySubmission(id : Guid, approverRole : UserRole) : SendResult
    + NotifyResult(id : Guid, action : string) : SendResult
  }
  note bottom of INotifier
    Kênh, nội dung, lỗi gửi: OQ-US02-02.
    Có thông báo kết quả duyệt không: OQ-US03-05.
  end note
}

package "External <<external, read-only>>" {
  interface IContractReader {
    + ListCandidates(user : CurrentUser) : IReadOnlyList<ContractInfo>
    + GetContract(contractId : int) : ContractInfo?
  }
  interface IPriceReader {
    + ListCandidates(contractId : int, period : BillingPeriod) : IReadOnlyList<PriceListInfo>
    + GetPriceList(priceListId : string) : PriceListInfo?
  }
  interface IQuantityReader {
    + GetQuantities(contractId : int, period : BillingPeriod) : IReadOnlyList<QuantityRecord>
  }
}

PaymentSheet "1" *-- "0..*" PaymentLine : gồm
PaymentSheet "1" --> "1" PaymentSheetStatus
PaymentSheet "1" *-- "1" BillingPeriod
PaymentSheet "1" <-- "1..*" AuditEntry : ghi lại
PaymentSheet "1" <-- "0..*" PaymentAdjustment : điều chỉnh
CurrentUser "1" --> "1" UserRole

PaymentController ..> PaymentService
PaymentController ..> PaymentApprovalService
PaymentController ..> PaymentAdjustmentService
PaymentController ..> CurrentUser

PaymentService ..> IPaymentRepository
PaymentService ..> IAuditLog
PaymentService ..> IUnitOfWork
PaymentService ..> INotifier
PaymentService ..> IContractReader
PaymentService ..> IPriceReader
PaymentService ..> IQuantityReader
PaymentService ..> PaymentSheet

PaymentApprovalService ..> IPaymentRepository
PaymentApprovalService ..> IAuditLog
PaymentApprovalService ..> IUnitOfWork
PaymentApprovalService ..> INotifier

PaymentAdjustmentService ..> IPaymentRepository
PaymentAdjustmentService ..> IAdjustmentRepository
PaymentAdjustmentService ..> IAuditLog
PaymentAdjustmentService ..> IUnitOfWork

IPaymentRepository ..> PaymentSheet
IAdjustmentRepository ..> PaymentAdjustment
IAuditLog ..> AuditEntry

' Bố cục: trái -> phải; liên kết ẩn chỉ để sắp xếp, không phải quan hệ UML
IPaymentRepository -[hidden]down- PaymentSheet
IAdjustmentRepository -[hidden]down- PaymentAdjustment

legend right
  Tên theo 03-detailed-design-v1 §1. DTO (ContractInfo, PriceListInfo,
  QuantityRecord, Selection, Result…) và endpoint: 04-api-contract-v1.
  <<Blocked by OQ-…>> = [GIẢ ĐỊNH – Cần xác nhận], chưa phải thiết kế cuối
endlegend
@enduml


